"html": "<!-- keyword-gap:start --><section class=\"section keyword-gap-content\" data-keyword-gap><div class=\"shell service-reading\"><div class=\"keyword-gap-part\" id=\"gap-managed-work-order\"><h2>A clear plumbing or electrical work order</h2><p>Use the same property reference for the occupant report, requested assessment and approval. The example below is an illustrative format, not a completed customer job or a client endorsement. Adapt it to the actual property and confirm the accepted scope with the team.</p><ul><li>Property: address and unit; identify the affected room or common area.</li><li>Observation: for example, “the kitchen tap continues to drip when closed”; record what the occupant reported, not an unverified diagnosis.</li><li>Instruction: assess the stated issue and quote the proposed work; name who may approve investigation and additional repairs.</li><li>Access: nominated contact and agreed entry arrangements; share keys or private codes through an agreed private channel.</li><li>Records: state any agency reference, completion notes, photographs or invoice breakdown required, and confirm what will be provided.</li></ul><ul class=\"intent-links\"><li><a href=\"news-clearer-property-maintenance-enquiry.html\">Prepare the first maintenance enquiry</a></li><li><a href=\"news-useful-property-work-order.html\">Define an assessable work-order scope</a></li><li><a href=\"smoke-alarm-maintenance-perth.html#gap-smoke-alarm-testing\">Specify the smoke-alarm work and record required</a></li></ul></div><div class=\"keyword-gap-part\" id=\"learn-about-property-management\"><h2>Plumbing and Electrical Maintenance in Perth: Work-Order Questions</h2><h3>Reporting repairs as a tenant</h3><p>For an ordinary repair, contact the managing agent or landlord and follow the agreed reporting and approval process. Immediate danger or utility emergencies need the correct emergency contact first. Responsibility and authorisation should be confirmed for the particular property.</p><ul class=\"intent-links\"><li><a href=\"insights-tenant-property-manager-maintenance-handover.html\">Tenant and manager repair handover</a></li></ul></div></div></section>" as TrustedHtml
},
